"recommendationid": "83681730", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135004458", "personaname": "Higgs Monaghan", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/goodoldfashionbossfight/", "num_games_owned": 395, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 4113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1203, "last_played": 1726449617, "avatar": "0b9f743e2f488d2c4cf62b8065021dd15707b0b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Feels like a mashup of Borderlands and a Roguelike while still feeling different. I don't think, \"man I'm just playing Borderlands\" It feels like the fun mechanics of a Borderlands game mashed with the fun and grindy replay ability. As the game gets more content, there will be much to do, but as of now I have roughly 20 hours, and almost have everything unlocked. This game is still very enjoyable, and would easily tell anyone to give it a whirl.", "timestamp_created": 1609451280, "timestamp_updated": 1609451280, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}